  "bodyHash": "WkdkG1ZKCJ0=",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>理智：陷入瘋狂</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">這款Minecraft模組將<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f219740%252fDont_Starve%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">飢荒</span></a>中的理智機制引入Minecraft。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><strong>需求</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.19.4.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更新時請務必刪除設定檔以重新生成並應用新設定。但請記得備份自己的修改內容。</span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組介紹</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組新增需要管理的生存指標——理智值，即你的心理健康量表。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若無法維持高理智值，將對生存造成嚴重後果，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">甚至可能導致死亡。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">隨著理智值下降，你會開始出現幻聽與幻視，視野變得混濁模糊，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">思緒也逐漸混沌，最終將被自身意識創造的內在實體攻擊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">部分生物也會對你不穩定的精神狀態產生特殊反應...</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/croissantnova/SanityDescentIntoMadness/main/readme/sanity_animation.gif\" alt=\"理智值變化動畫\" width=\"325\" height=\"134\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">恢復與喪失理智的方式有多種，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/croissantnova/SanityDescentIntoMadness/wiki/Activities-that-affect-sanity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a>查看完整清單。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建議首先採集旅途中的小花朵製作花環，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這個可愛的飾品能暫時維持理智。但請注意，接觸水會加速花環枯萎！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/croissantnova/SanityDescentIntoMadness/main/readme/garland_craft.png\" alt=\"花環合成表\" width=\"242\" height=\"128\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>詳細說明</strong></span></p><blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組具高度可定制性，詳見<a href=\"https://github.com/croissantnova/SanityDescentIntoMadness/blob/main/config.toml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">設定檔案</a>。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支援維度專屬設定：<span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">config/sanitydim/dimension/custom_config.toml</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎將本模組納入模組包使用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>已知問題</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">mc1.16版本：目前存在實體動畫錯誤，但不影響遊戲體驗</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n</blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>製作群</strong></span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">croissantnova - 程式設計與美術，</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/toujourspareil_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">toujourspareil</a> - 美術（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.ibb.co%252f1n03LBG%252f2023-06-18-14-34.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">授權證明</a>）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">音效由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.zapsplat.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zapsplat</a>提供。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>授權條款</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">詳見<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fcroissantnova%252fSanityDescentIntoMadness%252fmain%252fLICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">授權文件</a>。</span></p>\n\n（注：已根据繁体中文用语习惯进行本地化调整，包括：\n1. \"Sanity\"译为\"理智\"而非\"精神健康\"\n2. 使用\"模組\"代替\"模组\"\n3. 采用\"設定檔/設定\"代替\"配置文件/配置\"\n4. 保留专有名词原文（如Minecraft/Forge/GeckoLib）\n5. 语气措辞符合繁体中文语境\n6. 图片alt标签已本地化\n7. 特殊格式与超链接均完整保留）",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
